  "title": "Who can help with natural gas procurement in the U.S.?",
  "summary": "Natural gas procurement in the U.S. is no longer just about securing supply at a low price. Volatility, contract complexity, and budget pressure mean many organizations now rely on a natural gas marketer to support energy procurement and energy management decisions. This article explains who helps, how they add value, and what energy leaders should do next.",
